// Load MODIS Terra (morning) and Aqua (afternoon) data for January 15, 2024
// Terra typically passes in the morning (~10:30 AM local time)
// Aqua typically passes in the afternoon (~1:30 PM local time)

// Morning data from Terra MODIS
